```

**Configure API Keys**

Set `COMPOSIO_API_KEY` with your API key from [Settings](https://dashboard.composio.dev/~/project/settings/api-keys) and `OPENAI_API_KEY` with your [OpenAI API key](https://platform.openai.com/api-keys).

